WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.373
Surveillance video catches

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.574
a Delhi street quarter

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:09.442
to nine on Sunday evening.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.744
What the man in blue is about to

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.846
do is too violent to be shown

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.280
in the next moments.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.950
A 16 year old girl's life is taken.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.586
Stabbed and bludgeoned with a rock

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.454
against the wall of her house.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.091
Witnesses pass by, but no one intervenes.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.627
Violence against women is so pervasive

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:28.328
in India

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.096
that a young girl can be stabbed

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.197
in public

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.699
in a busy neighborhood

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.135
against the wall of a home.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.369
The killing of this teenage

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.604
girl is the latest

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.439
in a long line of violent crimes

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.941
against women in India.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.710
This time it's on film,

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.446
shared rapidly online, and it has gripped

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.881
the nation.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.649
The man in blue has been arrested

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.550
for the murder

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.953
and named by police simply as Sahil.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.322
Police say the two were in a relationship

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.124
and had an argument shortly

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.759
before the killing.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:01.828
The family pleading for justice,

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.229
even as across

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.964
India demands grew to do more

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.232
to protect women

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.668
and punish their male attackers.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.970
But public anger is no comfort

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.638
to families

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.173
stricken by grief

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:15.175
at the loss of their child

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:17.010
within the next.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.411
I feel lifeless

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.283
I miss her so much.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:26.152
She was such a good child.

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.787
What to do

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.527
Her mother, inconsolable

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.764
as a daughter, was cremated Monday near

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.533
she went to the bazaar to buy some things

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:41.868
and then went to celebrate

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.336
a friend's birthday.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.271
She had gone to buy some new sandals

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.539
for the birthday.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.740
The sandals are now

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.476
at the police station.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.844
Life continues

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.245
in this poor neighborhood

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:54.214
in north west Delhi.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.816
Investigators have marked a small cross

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.417
in the place

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:59.919
where the young girl was killed.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.856
One more place where women aren't safe

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.524
from men.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.793
Balika. CNN, New Delhi.

